; =================================================================
; THpropensities_complete.dat
; Complete Gly-X-Y triplet Tm database for THeBuScr
; =================================================================
;
; PROVENANCE:
;   Experimental values:    81
;   Additivity (Eq. 2):     339
;   Fallback estimates:      21
;   Total:                   441 / 441
;
; Experimental sources:
;   [P2000] Persikov et al. Biochemistry 39(48):14960 (2000)
;   [P2002] Persikov et al. JMB 316:385 (2002)
;   [P2005] Persikov et al. JBC 280:19343 (2005)
;
; Additivity formula (Eq. 2 from P2005):
;   Tm(GXY) = Tm(GXO) + Tm(GPY) - Tm(GPO)
;
; Fallback: for triplets missing one component (mainly Gly-O-Y),
; the missing component is replaced with the average destabilization
; across all measured residues at that position.
;
; Any G-X-Y propensities not listed will be calculated as an average
; of the appropriate pair of G-X-Hyp and G-Pro-Y. Any non-Gly G-
; positions will return a propensity of 0, unless Tcl script itself
; is modified.
;

